# Build context is the repo root. Keep it small and never ship host-built
# artifacts into the image — deps are installed fresh from the lockfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/coverage

.git
.gitignore
.claude
**/.vscode
**/.idea

**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
